From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Skin Fixer Tooling <tooling@skinfixer.local>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 07:48:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: skin weight tools foundation (Even Out, layers, ROM
 test)

Adds Tools > Skin Weight Tools > Weight Editor, an editor-side toolkit for
repairing bad skin weights on imported skinned meshes.

Runtime (SkinWeightTools asmdef):
- SkinWeightSet: variable-length influence container, reads and writes Mesh
  via GetAllBoneWeights / SetBoneWeights so influence counts above four survive.
- TopologyGraph: position-welded adjacency plus multi-source Dijkstra distance
  fields. Welding searches the 27 neighbouring spatial-hash cells so pairs
  straddling a cell boundary are not missed at UV and normal seams.
- EvenOutSettings: search radius, falloff curve with five presets, blend,
  new-bone bias, smoothing and thresholds.
- SkinWeightSolver: EVEN OUT 2/3/4. Each bone gets a distance field seeded from
  the vertices it owns; every vertex scores nearby bones through the falloff
  curve, keeps the best N and renormalises. Falls back to seeding a bone from
  the vertices it dominates when nothing clears the seed threshold, so thinly
  weighted bones are not dropped entirely.
- WeightLayer / WeightLayerStack: tighten, loosen, smooth and normalize layers
  with topological masks and per-layer bone filters.
- RomSequence: humanoid joint definitions with symmetric and asymmetric step
  ordering, rest-pose capture and restore.

Editor (SkinWeightTools.Editor asmdef):
- SkinnedMeshImportUtility: FBX, glTF, GLB and USD import. Detects glTFast and
  USD packages by reflection and reports what is missing rather than failing
  silently. Forces isReadable and maxBonesPerVertex 32 on the model importer so
  the solver sees raw weights.
- MeshWeightWriter: always clones before editing, since model-imported meshes
  are read-only sub-assets. The source file is never modified.
- RomTestRunner: drives each joint through its range, bakes at every sample and
  measures per-edge length distortion against the rest pose. Cancellable, and
  restores the rest pose in a finally block.
- SkinWeightToolsWindow: four tabs (Source, Even Out, Layers, ROM), warns when
  welding produced almost no groups, and feeds ROM problem areas into layer masks.

Purely additive. No existing project files are touched.
